    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modavuj Games presents the game &quot;Save The Babies&quot;.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572640/extras/603ce1f05f25c01dc3928cfe8657ea82.poster.avif?t=1754505328\" width=640 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572640/extras/603ce1f05f25c01dc3928cfe8657ea82.webm?t=1754505328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572640/extras/603ce1f05f25c01dc3928cfe8657ea82.mp4?t=1754505328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The subject of the game Save The Babies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A malicious organization that carries out illegal activities wants to access a lot of secret information from the state. For this reason, it has kidnapped the daughters of important statesmen. The organization hides these kidnapped girls in a large industrial zone protected by artificial intelligence robot soldiers. The state has planned a top-secret operation called &quot;Save The Babies&quot; to save these girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For this operation, you, our hero, codenamed &quot;Bodyguard&quot;, one of the state's best agents, have been chosen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572640/extras/f448412cba57544f677a35c02011c960.poster.avif?t=1754505328\" width=640 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572640/extras/f448412cba57544f677a35c02011c960.webm?t=1754505328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572640/extras/f448412cba57544f677a35c02011c960.mp4?t=1754505328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's in the game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will engage in armed conflicts with artificial intelligence robot soldiers. You will also use vehicles, motorcycles and bicycles to reach each of the 8 stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will try to reach the kidnapped girls by jumping on the moving stone blocks without falling into the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will try to move quickly without getting caught by the rolling stone balls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572640/extras/dbf0d56398781185d3992dc32251db78.poster.avif?t=1754505328\" width=640 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572640/extras/dbf0d56398781185d3992dc32251db78.webm?t=1754505328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572640/extras/dbf0d56398781185d3992dc32251db78.mp4?t=1754505328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to complete the game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will complete the game when you find the 8 kidnapped girls in 8 different stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy the game. Have fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modavuj Games presents the game &quot;Save The Babies&quot;.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572640/extras/603ce1f05f25c01dc3928cfe8657ea82.poster.avif?t=1754505328\" width=640 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572640/extras/603ce1f05f25c01dc3928cfe8657ea82.webm?t=1754505328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572640/extras/603ce1f05f25c01dc3928cfe8657ea82.mp4?t=1754505328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The subject of the game Save The Babies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A malicious organization that carries out illegal activities wants to access a lot of secret information from the state. For this reason, it has kidnapped the daughters of important statesmen. The organization hides these kidnapped girls in a large industrial zone protected by artificial intelligence robot soldiers. The state has planned a top-secret operation called &quot;Save The Babies&quot; to save these girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For this operation, you, our hero, codenamed &quot;Bodyguard&quot;, one of the state's best agents, have been chosen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572640/extras/f448412cba57544f677a35c02011c960.poster.avif?t=1754505328\" width=640 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572640/extras/f448412cba57544f677a35c02011c960.webm?t=1754505328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.